---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
const seo = { title: 'Terms of Service — BrandsBuilders', description: 'Terms governing services provided by BrandsBuilders.', canonical: 'https://brandsbuilders.ca/terms-of-service' };
---
<Layout seo={seo}>
<section class="bg-white py-20">
  <div class="container mx-auto px-6 max-w-3xl">
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-wider mb-4">Legal</p>
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Terms of Service</h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-12">Last updated: 2026-06-18</p>
    <div class="prose prose-gray max-w-none text-gray-600 leading-relaxed space-y-6">
      <p>BrandsBuilders builds websites and manages Google and/or Meta ad campaigns for cleaning companies in Calgary and the surrounding area (Airdrie, Cochrane, Chestermere, Okotoks).</p>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mt-8">Services</h2>
      <p>Services include: a custom-built website for the client's cleaning business, and ongoing management of Google Ads and/or Meta Ads campaigns targeted at residential clients, commercial clients, or both, as selected by the client.</p>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mt-8">Fees</h2>
      <p>The service fee for the website build and ad management is agreed with the client before work begins. Ad spend is separate from this fee and is billed directly by Google and/or Meta to the client's own ad account — it is not paid to or held by BrandsBuilders.</p>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mt-8">30-Day Guarantee</h2>
      <p>If the client is not satisfied with the website build or the ad management within the first 30 days from the start of service, BrandsBuilders will refund the service fee paid for that work. Ad spend already paid directly to Google or Meta is not covered by this guarantee, as those funds are paid to the ad platforms and not to BrandsBuilders.</p>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mt-8">Reporting &amp; Transparency</h2>
      <p>Clients receive reporting on ad campaign performance, including leads generated, cost per lead, and conversions. No fixed lead-volume guarantee is made beyond the 30-day satisfaction guarantee above; results depend on market conditions, ad spend, and the client's own follow-up with leads.</p>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mt-8">Ownership</h2>
      <p>The client retains ownership of their website, domain, and ad accounts at all times.</p>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mt-8">Governing Law</h2>
      <p>These Terms are governed by the laws of the Province of Alberta and Canadian federal law.</p>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mt-8">Contact</h2>
      <p>BrandsBuilders · Calgary, Alberta, Canada · <a href="mailto:admin@brandsbuilders.ca" class="text-orange-600">admin@brandsbuilders.ca</a></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
</Layout>
